<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Copper.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Copper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on copper.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE TENTH OF ONE TONNE OF COPPER.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE*    ISSUE	 PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> TRANCHE A  $2000	$30.10	1.37 PCT     7.54 X</p>
<p> TRANCHE B  $2200	$16.40	4.14 PCT     13.84 X</p>
<p>NOTES  *U.S. DOLLARS PER TONNE</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
